  "keyFeatures": [
    "Zero external dependencies — runs on Python standard library only",
    "Bidirectional keepalive at both application and TCP level",
    "Path-based message routing with middleware support",
    "Blueprint system for modular handler organization",
    "TLS and mutual TLS (mTLS) with client certificate verification",
    "Token and username/password authentication with handshake protocol",
    "Multi-codec compression: zlib, lzma, bz2, gzip, zstd, brotli",
    "Non-blocking async request/reply with RequestHandle and callbacks",
    "Built-in structured logging and Prometheus-compatible metrics",
    "Protocol version negotiation between client and server",
    "Graceful drain/shutdown with in-flight handler completion",
    "Backpressure controls via bounded outbound queues and dispatcher worker pools",
    "Shared selector event loop for scalable server connections",
    "Full type annotations for IDE support"
  ],
